{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:17 2026-06-24 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:17 2026-06-24 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:17 2026-06-24 HKT</p><p>今日（24日）早上近10時半，警方接獲報案，指黃大仙竹園道鵬程苑外，一名年約60歲男子昏迷倒地。救護員趕到，將事主送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。現場是水務署工程工地，離地約5至6米高。據了解，事主被鋼索擊中頭部，昏迷不醒送院搶救。</p><img alt=\"現場為水務署工地，離地深約5至6米。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/00ad2f599cd417072aac0d55b948d3db/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_58_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為水務署工地，離地深約5至6米。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a9deef89558b56c64b3945fd742db988/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_58_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5d8f53c86cebc3803cfdb6138caa3115/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_58_13_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工人遭鋼索擊中昏迷送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d4cd05788d6a1ed9d78c8886dac189b6/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_58_13.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d34e9540ce2bef9b674f8543959105a5/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_58_13_0.jpeg\"/><p>現場消息稱，當時男工在離地約5至6米高的工地，預先做好準備工作，以便稍後將水管吊下。詎料其間男工身旁的一部機器，懷疑突然鋼索斷裂，斷開的鋼索登時飛彈，擊中他的頭部。警方將案件列作工業意外，正調查事故原因。</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/22279b8c89a24ab74583b4619fe862e5/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_58_12.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dfd6b7d48646acc62629dc2db5c990e1/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_57_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方調查事件。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d5aa1b299100c2b9d5f15a62f04b3aab/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_13_15.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男工昏迷，由救護車送院搶救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ade61efe886e3c2709ddaec7c19a6fc7/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_13_13.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f6817c7b1d2efc2518a785c7f5fc9945/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-24_at_12_13_14_0.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-24T05:39:24.011034+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}